        "effect": "The triggering creature takes 3d10+22 force damage and is knocked back 10 feet. A creature that succeeds at a DC 30 Will save takes half damage and isn't moved. On a failure, the creature is additionally cursed. A cursed creature takes a \u20132 penalty to Will saves, and whenever the cursed creature becomes affected by a spell, the creature takes 1d10 force damage. The curse remains until removed by *cleanse affliction* or similar magic.",
